# Provenance of the committed baseline PNGs in this directory (Track U U0).
#
# `playwright install` pins the browser build PER PLAYWRIGHT VERSION only —
# each playwright release bundles one specific chromium build, and the command
# always installs whatever build the installed playwright wants. So the
# playwright version itself is pinned in .github/workflows/ci.yml (both the
# web-ui and snapshots jobs) and recorded here. Bumping playwright means
# regenerating the baselines (see README.md) and updating BOTH ci.yml pins
# and this file in the same commit.
#
# Baselines generated: 2026-06-16 (commit e5ee6a4) by the CI snapshots job
# (workflow_dispatch update_snapshots=true) on ubuntu-latest. At that date the
# job's `pip install playwright` (then unpinned) resolved to the version
# below; ci.yml now pins exactly it.

playwright==1.60.0
chromium-build=1223
chromium-version=148.0.7778.96
